Both nucleotide tasks come from the revised downstream tasks of the Nucleotide Transformer \citep{DallaTorre2025}, downloaded from Hugging Face (\nolinkurl{InstaDeepAI/nucleotide_transformer_downstream_tasks_revised}). The download is not pinned to a revision; the files used are those of revision \texttt{851f994}, dated 30 June 2025, the latest at the time of writing. The released training and test files are merged. Each sequence's chromosome is read from its name, and the folds are grouped by chromosome. Nothing else is filtered, and no sequence contains a letter other than A, C, G or T. Both tasks cover chromosomes 1 to 21, X and Y; chromosome 22 is absent.

